WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.519
As the fly walks to the middle of this symmetrical
maze, he has to decide whether to turn left

00:00:05.519 --> 00:00:10.980
or right. Then he turns around and does it
again, continuing for hours. A single camera

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:17.250
tracks an array of 120 flies. With multiple
arrays, scientists can monitor 1,000 flies

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.290
simultaneously.

